%%{init: {"themeVariables": {"fontFamily": "Noto Sans CJK SC, PingFang SC, Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif"}}}%%
flowchart TD
    Loop["for (i = 0; i &lt; n; i++)"]
    Choice{"验证器是否知道<br/>n 的上界？"}

    Yes["展开循环：<br/>将每次迭代作为<br/>独立路径分析"]
    No["无界 → 拒绝"]

    Path1["迭代 0：以 i=0 的寄存器状态<br/>探索循环体"]
    Path2["迭代 1：以 i=1 的寄存器状态<br/>探索循环体"]
    PathN["迭代 N-1：以 i=N-1 的状态<br/>探索循环体"]
    Cost["复杂度：O(n × body_complexity)<br/>每次迭代都在循环体内分叉路径"]

    Loop --> Choice
    Choice -->|是，n 有界| Yes
    Choice -->|否| No
    Yes --> Path1
    Path1 --> Path2
    Path2 --> PathN
    PathN --> Cost
    Cost --> Limit{"是否触及 1M 条指令的<br/>复杂度预算？"}
    Limit -->|是| Reject(["REJECT:<br/>BPF program too large"])
    Limit -->|否| OK(["接受"])
    No --> Reject2(["REJECT:<br/>back-edge to insn N"])

    classDef bad fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626
    classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a
    classDef hot fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706
    class Reject,Reject2 bad
    class OK ok
    class Choice,Limit hot
